{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10124360","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10124360","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1012436001:0":{"text":"이 녀석이 달빛 그림자의 수호 동물이었다니...","source_cn":"没想到这家伙居然是月影乡的守护兽……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B4D484300805046","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1012436002:0":{"text":"어쩐지 녀석에게서 악의가 느껴지지 않았습니다. 녀석은 그저 저희를 시험하고 있었던 것이었군요.","source_cn":"怪不得此前从未感受到它的恶意，它只是在考验我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC5326D8313A6344","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012436003:0":{"text":"좋아. 어떤 시험이든 난 절대 물러서지 않을 거야!","source_cn":"很好，无论是怎样的考验，我绝不退缩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5831D468CDE1A5E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"브라이언","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}}